# How fast the cursor steps on the commands with a direction held: at once, and then every 14 frames. The holds are cut
# so that the end tells: 29 frames down is 3 steps, but 2 at a step every 15 frames. 27 up is 2 steps, but 3 at
# a step every 13. So the cursor ends one row below the first command only at 14.

